  "description": "Forwards System.Diagnostics.Activity spans into Datadog: name the ActivitySources you care\n      about and their activities become Datadog spans - tags, error status and parentage carried\n      across, sampled and RUM-correlated exactly like spans written through IDatadogTracer. The\n      join between .NET's built-in instrumentation ecosystem and DatadogNet's Trace feature, for\n      MAUI and plain .NET Android/iOS/Mac Catalyst apps.",
